atable healthy suffix with no emitted leave proposal would refute automatic continuation without inventing a deadline; finite noncompletion without recurrence would remain unknown.\",\n        \"applicability\": \"Implicit joint mode with completion of the entering entry, transfer no longer active, and all ordinary protocol/application duties served.\",\n        \"unresolved\": [\n          \"The proposed recurrence observation must account for all behavior-determining state, queued messages, timers, callbacks and caller work.\"\n        ],\n        \"conflicts\": [],\n        \"alternatives\": [\n          \"Later client work or a leadership change could rescue the transition, but those are separate stimuli and are not used to define automatic continuation under the stable suffix.\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"version\": 1,\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"claims\",\n        \"match\": {\n          \"id\": \"O-auto-joint-continuation\",\n          \"version\": 1\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pending_work\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"unit-O-auto-joint-continuation\",\n      \"candidate_id\": \"741e5e2156e4421abc1c95cb51fe0704\",\n      \"kind\": \"unit\",\n      \"remaining\": [\n        \"O-auto-joint-continuation\"\n      ],\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"units\",\n        \"match\": {\n          \"id\": \"unit-O-auto-joint-continuation\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\nPLAN {\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"description\": \"Concrete investigation of an accepted requirement; execution determines the observed result.\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"description\": {\n      \"description\": \"This check\\u2019s discriminator, prefix, controls and observations; reference the accepted claim rather than restating it\",\n      \"title\": \"Description\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"claim_id\": {\n      \"title\": \"Claim Id\",\n      